<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-track-file-conflicts">
    <title>Track In-Progress Operations</title>
    <body>
    <p>During in-progress operations, the Git Client shows the current operation on
        <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> and visualizes it in the revision graph on
        <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol>. In-progress operations include merging, rebasing,
      cherry-picking, and reverting.</p>
    <p id="p_git_conflict_state_panel">The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view identifies the
      operation type (for example, <uicontrol>Merging...</uicontrol>).</p>
    <p><fig id="fig_w1z_y4b_mjc">
        <title>Git Staging view during a merge conflict</title>
        <image href="img/staging/merge-conflict-staging.png" id="image_hwf_trb_mjc"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <p>The <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> table displays an amber label next to the current
      commit and the source commit. Changes from the source commit are applied to the current
      commit.</p>
    <p>The current commit is always labeled <uicontrol>Start (Mine)</uicontrol>. Source commit
      labels vary by operation:</p>
    <p><table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_bwh_vjc_mjc">
        <title>Source commit labels</title>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colnum="3" colname="newCol3" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry>Operation</entry>
              <entry>Label</entry>
              <entry>What it identifies</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry>Merge</entry>
              <entry><uicontrol>Incoming (Theirs)</uicontrol></entry>
              <entry>The merge source commit.</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>Rebase</entry>
              <entry><uicontrol>HEAD</uicontrol></entry>
              <entry>The rebase source commit.</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>Cherry-pick</entry>
              <entry><uicontrol>Cherry-picked commit</uicontrol></entry>
              <entry>The cherry-picked commit.</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>Revert</entry>
              <entry><uicontrol>Reverted commit</uicontrol></entry>
              <entry>The commit the branch will revert to.</entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </p>
    <p>The Git Client also draws a dashed grey line from the source commit to the current branch's
        <uicontrol>Uncommitted changes</uicontrol> node.</p>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_elv_xrb_mjc">
        <title>Git History view during a merge conflict</title>
        <image href="img/history/merge-conflict-history.png" id="image_hj4_1sb_mjc"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    </body>
</topic>
